  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "We have<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/v4Z1kTVNykWyCrgSFIT-Hx_GqWd1cn_W85BMAa4x06o.original.fullsize.png\"><br><br />Multiplying both sides by $\\frac{1}{3}$, we get<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/rGNr5MT4r0M2gB_qD0WW5Cd7tquZXrpCI5abkeFzpcU.original.fullsize.png\"><br><br />Subtracting eqn. (ii) from eqn. (i), we get<br />$\\begin{aligned} & \\frac{2}{3} S=1+\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{4}{3^2}+\\frac{4}{3^3}+\\frac{4}{3^4}+\\ldots \\ldots \\ldots \\infty \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\frac{2}{3} S=\\frac{4}{3}+\\frac{4}{3^2}+\\frac{4}{3^3}+\\frac{4}{3^4}+\\ldots \\ldots \\ldots \\infty \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\frac{2}{3} S=\\frac{\\frac{4}{3}}{1-\\frac{1}{3}}=\\frac{4}{3} \\times \\frac{3}{2} \\Rightarrow S=3\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
